<title>USA: Dryden Central SD, N.Y., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Dryden Central SD, N.Y., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudetial Securities Inc. said it won $12.025 million of Dryden Central School District, N.Y., unlimited tax school district serial bonds, 1997 with a net interest cost of 5.506 percent.</p>
</text>
